  [step 1] run_python({'code': 'from collections import Counter\nimport os\n\ntext = open(\'data.txt\', encoding=\'utf-8\').read()\nwords = text.split()\nc = Counter(words)\ntop_word, top_count = c.most_common(1)[0]\n\nresult = f"出现最多的词: {top_word} (出现 {top_count} 次)\\n\\n完整词频统计:\\n"\nfor w, n in c.most_common():\n    result += f"{w}: {n}\\n"\n\nopen(\'result.txt\', \'w\', encoding=\'utf-8\').write(result)\nprint(result)'}) -> 出现最多的词: apple (出现 10 次)

